@startuml
skinparam roundcorner 8

actor "Marché Spot" as Market
participant "Twelve Data" as Provider
participant "LiveMarketService" as WSService
participant "XAUUSDIngestionWorker" as Worker
database "MongoDB\n(market_data)" as DB
participant "PredictionService" as PredService
participant "ModelServingEngine" as ML
actor "Utilisateur Frontend" as User

Market -> Provider: Variations du cours XAU/USD
Provider -> WSService: Flux continu de ticks (WS)
WSService -> User: Push instantané sur Dashboard Next.js

Provider -> Worker: Requête périodique bougie H1 fermée (REST)
Worker -> DB: Upsert bougie avec index unique (symbol, timeframe, timestamp)

User -> PredService: Consultation prédiction (GET /api/predictions/XAUUSD)
PredService -> DB: Récupération des dernières bougies H1, H4, M15
PredService -> PredService: Calcul des 87 features causales
PredService -> ML: Inférence (dernier vecteur de features)
ML -> PredService: Probabilités (BULLISH/BEARISH), Confiance
PredService -> User: Réponse structurée (Biais, Confiance, Top 8 Features, Scénarios)

@enduml

